{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1210708001:0":{"text":"シンドバッドさん、海ネズミってなんですか？それに、ギャングについてやたら詳しいようですが……","source_cn":"辛巴达，水耗子是什么意思？你为什么对水鬼帮的事这么了解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9324F2D1A6684EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210708002:0":{"text":"海ネズミは、ブラッディ・マリーのスパイのことだ。やつらは互いに相手のことを探ってるからな。","source_cn":"抓水耗子就是抓血薇帮的间谍，血薇帮也想派人渗透水鬼帮的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F98995556DB2214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210708003:0":{"text":"うちの仲間を何人売ったんだ？","source_cn":"你卖了多少血薇帮的弟兄？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CE7D39B22B60FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210708004:0":{"text":"そう睨むなよ、むしろ売るどころか、色々助けてやったんだぜ？","source_cn":"别瞪我，我不仅没卖，还放了不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C46D01B364A61E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210708005:0":{"text":"俺がただ金のためだけに、ギャングの仕事を手伝ってると思ってるのか？","source_cn":"难道你们以为我帮水鬼办事，就是为了钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7AEF6BB71C0217C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210708006:0":{"text":"拠点の場所や、メンバーの出どころ、趣味や魚の好みまで把握してるのはなぜだと思う？","source_cn":"嘿，那我为什么连他们的营地分布，成员来源，日常爱干什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D141C27DD358B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210708007:0":{"text":"あいつらを根絶やしにするこの日を待ってたのさ！","source_cn":"我等的就是把他们连根拔起的这一天呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E02008B2CE1649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210708008:0":{"text":"頼もしいな。なら、テシオの居場所も見当がついているのか？","source_cn":"干得不错，你知道水鬼会把泰西欧藏在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEB2F5457B78C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210708009:0":{"text":"テシオの性格なら、屋外でギャングたちと一緒のテントにはいたくないはずだ……","source_cn":"以泰西欧的性格，肯定不愿意在野外和水鬼挤帐篷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF135287BDFFD58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210708010:0":{"text":"となると、たぶん<style=\"highlight\">カテーナ号</style>にかくまわれてるんじゃないか？","source_cn":"泰西欧应该在<style=highlight>枷锁号<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1090E44303C2B809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_tit